		Bestiary: {
			Akutokuo: A colossal robot spider. It created the world's Corruption and Crimson, and in the end was consumed by its own infection. Its front legs reshape themselves into any weapon, and every blow it lands drains your strength into its own.
			Robitacon: Robots taken over by the world's infection, still wearing the shells and powers of the Robot Jack forms. Akutoku-ō births them from its abdomen.
			RoboMechanic: A friendly robot built from the cleansed parts of Robitacons. It sells robot gear and keeps its wrench handy.
		}

		Dialogue: {
			RoboMechanic: {
				Line1: Beep boop. Just kidding. I don't actually talk like that.
				Line2: Every Robitacon you bring down is another bolt for my collection.
				Line3: Need a jetpack? I've got jetpacks.
				Line4: My blueprints say I was made from at least four different robots. I try not to think about it.
				Line5: Keep your triggers clean. Rust is the real enemy.
				Warning: Something big is spinning webs in the infected lands. Its legs... they're weapons. All of them.
			}
		}

		Conditions: {
			DownedAkutoku: After Akutoku-ō has been defeated
		}

		DropConditions: {
			Underground: Dropped by enemies underground
		}
	}
